@host = http://localhost:5043
@token = TOKEN_BURAYA

### Veritabanı sağlık kontrolü
GET {{host}}/api/system/database-health

### JWT giriş
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "personnelNumber": "ADM-0001",
  "password": "YEREL_TEST_PAROLANIZ"
}

### Araçlar
GET {{host}}/api/vehicles?page=1&pageSize=100
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dashboard
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Arızalar
GET {{host}}/api/faults?page=1&pageSize=100
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
